    "en": {
      "name": "Amazoness Dramatic Rescue",
      "effect": "If you control an \"Amazoness\" monster or \"Harpie Lady\", you can activate this card the turn it was Set. Target 1 monster on the field; Special Summon 1 \"Harpie\" or \"Amazoness\" monster from your hand or Deck, and if you do, return the targeted monster to the hand. You can banish this card from your GY; add 1 \"Harpie\" or \"Amazoness\" monster from your GY or banishment to your hand. You can only use each effect of \"Amazoness Dramatic Rescue\" once per turn.",
      "official": false
    },
